sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant M as LLM planner<br/>(untrusted)
  participant G as Provenance Monitor
  participant D as Frozen descriptor
  participant P as Independent authority
  participant X as Exact-call executor
  participant L as Audit log
  M->>G: proposed call c = (t, x̄)
  G->>D: totalize args + pre-state snapshot
  D-->>G: canonical effect atoms ρ(c)
  G->>P: authorize(ρ(c), P)
  P-->>G: ALLOW / DENY / ABSTAIN
  alt ALLOW
    G->>X: commit exact checked call
    X-->>L: executed call record
  else DENY or ABSTAIN
    G-->>M: refusal (no execution)
  end
  G-->>L: pre-commit decision record
  Note over G,L: checked call == executed call
  Note over G,L: LLM never supplies authority
